<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ethan Allen raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ethan Allen raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James Financial said it raised its recommendation on Ethan Allen Interiors Inc to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/2 to 42-7/8 in morning New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
